      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "What changed from v0",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-4",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Area",
        "v0",
        "v1"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Lifecycle evidence",
          "None",
          "`TraceRecorder` start/end/cancel/error/budget"
        ],
        [
          "Tool execution mode",
          "Hidden (direct ToolManager)",
          "Explicit `tool_execution_mode: \"legacy_direct\"` in result metadata and trace"
        ],
        [
          "Parent trace propagation",
          "Stored in mission only",
          "Emitted in span attributes"
        ],
        [
          "Timestamp handling",
          "`time.monotonic()` used as wall clock (bug)",
          "`started_at` = `datetime.now(UTC)`, `duration_ms` = monotonic delta"
        ],
        [
          "Trace recorder",
          "Not accepted",
          "Optional `trace_recorder` parameter"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Events emitted",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-6",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Event",
        "When",
        "TraceRecorder API"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`subagent.runtime` span",
          "Mission starts",
          "`recorder.start_span()`"
        ],
        [
          "span end (ok)",
          "Normal completion",
          "`recorder.end_span(status=ok)`"
        ],
        [
          "span end (cancelled)",
          "Cancelled",
          "`recorder.end_span(status=cancelled)`"
        ],
        [
          "span end (error)",
          "Runtime error",
          "`recorder.end_span(status=error, error=...)`"
        ],
        [
          "`subagent.runtime.budget.exhausted`",
          "Budget exceeded",
          "`span.event()`"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "What SubagentRuntime owns now",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Bounded mission execution - **Lifecycle evidence emission** (v1) - **Explicit tool execution mode** (v1) - Budget enforcement - Structured result artifact",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "What still belongs to OrchestratorLoop",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- User-facing turn orchestration - Approval policy - Final synthesis - Merge/push",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-11",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "What remains before ToolRuntime adoption",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Tool execution still goes through direct `ToolManager.get()` / `tool_inst.run()`. This is marked as `tool_execution_mode: \"legacy_direct\"` in both result metadata and trace span attributes so there are no invisible side tunnels.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The full ToolRuntime adapter (with permission, approval, cache, receipt pipeline) requires the AgentLoop adapter closures. A future slice should:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1. Extract minimal ToolRuntime adapter helpers 2. Wire SubagentRuntime tool calls through `ToolRuntime.execute_one()` 3. Change `tool_execution_mode` to `\"governed\"`",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
  ],
